E51B:
  procedure options(main);
  /* [E2E-51/P1] LITERAL dividend, VARIABLE divisor: z = 1200 / b.
     Constant in DE is the MB3 multiply form (LHLD var / LXI D,k /
     CALL ?IM22N); DIV needs dividend DE = 1200 and divisor HL = b,
     so H-B-de predicts LHLD b / LXI D,x'04B0 / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD
     z.  H-B-stack: LXI H,1200 / PUSH H / LHLD b / POP D / ID22N.
     H-B-conv: decimal pool conversion (the LR12 out-of-range
     family).  A DR refusal is H-B-refuse. */
  dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  z = 1200 / b;
end E51B;
